    {
      "Original": "Off: a plugin must stall or drain twice within the repeat window before you get a toast, so one-off costs like opening a window stay quiet. Every incident is still recorded on the Incidents tab.",
      "Context": "[Culprit] SettingsTab.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "关闭时，同一插件必须在统计时段内出现两次卡顿或持续高耗时才会弹窗。打开窗口等一次性开销不会触发提醒，每次异常仍会记入「异常事件」页。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Only plugins with an incident, an error, or a 5 s average of 1 ms or more are listed.",
      "Context": "[Culprit] LiveTab.DrawTable",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "仅列出发生过异常、报告过错误或 5 秒内平均耗时至少为 1 毫秒的插件。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
